## Why This Is Asked
Tests understanding of Pub/Sub triggers, Cloud Functions, BigQuery streaming inserts, and idempotency.

## Key Concepts
- Pub/Sub triggers and Cloud Functions
- Idempotent writes using BigQuery insertId
- Date-partitioned tables for perf
- Minimal IAM and retry strategies
- Basic test plan with duplicates

## Code Example
```javascript
// Cloud Function (Pub/Sub trigger) schematic
const {BigQuery} = require('@google-cloud/bigquery');
const bigquery = new BigQuery();
exports.aggregateEvent = async (msg, context) => {
  const payload = JSON.parse(Buffer.from(msg.data, 'base64').toString());
  const eventId = payload.event_id;
  const userId = payload.user_id;
  const minute = new Date(payload.timestamp).toISOString().slice(0,16);
  const rows = [{insertId: eventId, user_id: userId, minute: minute}];
  await bigquery
    .dataset('analytics')
    .table('app_events_minutes')
    .insert(rows);
};
```

